    "https://careers.nus.edu.sg/": {
      "title": "Apply for Jobs",
      "description": "Apply for Jobs at National University of Singapore By continuing to use and navigate this website, you are agreeing to the use of cookies. Accept Close Apply for Jobs at National University of Singapore Skip to main content Sign In / Create Account HOME ALL JOBS ACADEMIC POSITIONS RESEARCH & OTHER TEACHING POSITIONS EXECUTIVE & ADMINISTRATIVE POSITIONS Sign In / Create Account HOME ALL JOBS ACADEMIC POSITIONS RESEARCH & OTHER TEACHING POSITIONS EXECUTIVE & ADMINISTRATIVE POSITIONS Sign In / Create Account HOME ALL JOBS ACADEMIC POSITIONS RESEARCH & OTHER TEACHING POSITIONS EXECUTIVE & ADMINISTRATIVE POSITIONS Notice: Page Upgrade in Progress We are currently upgrading this page to serve you better. The page will be available again on 1 September 2025, 6am. We appreciate your patience and understanding during this period. Thank you! Shaping Futures, Endless Career Possibilities Search Jobs Academic Positions Join NUS and be part of a world-class academic community, contributing to the University's mission of excellence in education, research, and service. Our academic positions (Tenure Track, Educator Track & Practice Track) offer ample opportunities for professional development and personal growth, while enabling you to make a meaningful impact on society. Research & Other Teaching Positions Be a part of NUS's vibrant scholarly community in a research or teaching position. Collaborate with leading academics, contribute to groundbreaking research and publications, or inspire and shape curriculum to drive academic excellence. Executive & Administrative Positions Contribute your leadership and expertise to NUS by joining our Executive and Administrative teams. These roles are crucial to our University's strategic growth and efficient daily operations, where your decision-making and industry experience will drive organisational excellence. Browse Jobs Browse Jobs Browse Jobs Why Join NUS? Legal Branding guidelines Contact us Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © National University of Singapore. All Rights Reserved."
